@startuml
title 分析类图（七）— 摄制预约用例职责
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5FAFF
skinparam classBorderColor #46637F
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
left to right direction
hide empty members
class "发起摄制预约控制" as CUCPR001 <<control>> {
  + 发起摄制预约(业务信息)
}
class "派发摄制任务控制" as CUCPR002 <<control>> {
  + 派发摄制任务(业务信息)
}
class "提交摄制成果控制" as CUCPR003 <<control>> {
  + 提交摄制成果(业务信息)
}
class "归档摄制成果控制" as CUCPR004 <<control>> {
  + 归档摄制成果(业务信息)
}
class "抢接摄制任务控制" as CUCPR005 <<control>> {
  + 抢接摄制任务(业务信息)
}
class "普通成员接口" as B0 <<boundary>>
class "部长接口" as B1 <<boundary>>
class "成员" as E0 <<entity>>
class "摄制日程" as E10 <<entity>>
class "摄制预约" as E12 <<entity>>
B0 ..> CUCPR001 : UC-PR-001
CUCPR001 ..> E0 : 委派责任
CUCPR001 ..> E10 : 委派责任
B1 ..> CUCPR002 : UC-PR-002
CUCPR002 ..> E0 : 委派责任
CUCPR002 ..> E12 : 委派责任
B0 ..> CUCPR003 : UC-PR-003
CUCPR003 ..> E0 : 委派责任
CUCPR003 ..> E12 : 委派责任
B0 ..> CUCPR004 : UC-PR-004
CUCPR004 ..> E0 : 委派责任
CUCPR004 ..> E12 : 委派责任
B0 ..> CUCPR005 : UC-PR-005
CUCPR005 ..> E0 : 委派责任
CUCPR005 ..> E12 : 委派责任
note "实体属性与操作详见前四张类图；\n实体间协作详见对应序列图。\n虚线表示职责依赖，不表示业务流转先后。" as Guidance
@enduml
